@baseUrl = https://localhost:7126
@sourceLocationId = 46599a6f-bc0f-4cf8-b6ad-83e9312a042c
@destinationLocationId = c2727378-b800-4077-b7cf-4541a97af1b1
@productId = ca6f2e9a-24b5-4194-bb2a-66ce34b6a469
@transferId = 9e8e527b-a2f3-4646-b3c4-e764d8c99a3d

### Check source balance before starting
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{sourceLocationId}}

### Check destination balance before starting
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{destinationLocationId}}

### Create a draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceLocationId": "{{sourceLocationId}}",
  "destinationLocationId": "{{destinationLocationId}}",
  "notes": "First branch delivery",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 5,
      "baselineUnitPrice": 7
    }
  ]
}

### Read the transfer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}

### Receiving before shipping must fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/receive

### Ship
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/ship

### Repeat shipping — no additional deduction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/ship

### Source balance after shipping
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{sourceLocationId}}

### Destination balance before receipt
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{destinationLocationId}}

### Receive
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/receive

### Repeat receipt — no additional increase
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/receive

### Destination balance after receipt
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{destinationLocationId}}

### Inspect the movement history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/movements?productId={{productId}}

### Cancelling a received transfer must fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/cancel